  "solution": {
    "text": "Expression $=(1-x)^{5} \\cdot(1+x)^{4}\\left(1+x^{2}\\right)^{4}$\r\n\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n=(1-x)\\left(1-x^{2}\\right)^{4}\\left(1+x^{2}\\right)^{4} \\\\\r\n\r\n=(1-x)\\left(1-x^{4}\\right)^{4}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore$ Coefficient of $x^{13}=-{ }^{4} \\mathrm{C}_{3}(-1)^{3}=4$",
